WEBVTT

00:28.095 --> 00:29.562
You fool.

00:29.630 --> 00:32.064
So you figured out
what our plan was.

00:32.466 --> 00:34.991
I give you credit for trying to escape...

00:35.069 --> 00:37.537
...with the Maiden of Life
who holds the key to our plan.

00:37.972 --> 00:41.908
Did you think
you could get away so easily?

00:42.476 --> 00:44.706
I've known you a long time.

00:45.112 --> 00:49.014
If you want to turn around now,
we can end this peacefully.

00:49.583 --> 00:53.019
Now, hand over the Maiden.

00:53.320 --> 00:54.719
You traitor!

00:55.155 --> 00:56.884
Chelsea Rorec...

00:59.560 --> 01:00.390
Seki...

01:01.996 --> 01:02.985
We'll be okay.

01:03.764 --> 01:04.458
But...

01:05.299 --> 01:07.164
Just stay right here.

01:07.668 --> 01:08.726
All right, Ruri?

01:25.486 --> 01:27.977
So you want to use that against me?

01:29.356 --> 01:30.482
I see.

01:31.125 --> 01:33.992
The Maiden of Life's bodyguard...

01:34.061 --> 01:36.996
...intends to use
her gravity power on me?

01:38.832 --> 01:39.730
How interesting!

01:40.868 --> 01:41.596
Fine!

01:42.636 --> 01:46.629
Have a taste of my power of flame!

01:47.274 --> 01:50.209
I don't want to have it
out with you right now.

01:50.644 --> 01:51.372
What?

01:51.612 --> 01:56.879
A large quantity of water
falls on the surface called "rain."

02:00.054 --> 02:01.316
Water drops?

02:01.855 --> 02:03.345
Coming down from the surface?

02:04.425 --> 02:05.016
Rain?

02:05.793 --> 02:06.589
Damn!

02:07.061 --> 02:10.360
Have we already come
that close to the surface?!

02:10.564 --> 02:14.933
My mission is to rescue Ruri
from the Company...

02:15.169 --> 02:17.694
...and bring her to the surface!

02:18.939 --> 02:19.735
Forget it.

02:20.107 --> 02:21.972
You can't punch a hole...

02:22.042 --> 02:24.010
...through that thick concrete!

02:24.344 --> 02:26.710
To the surface
where the sun shines!

02:29.983 --> 02:31.348
I can't believe it!

02:32.953 --> 02:36.616
How can she harness
such a powerful gravity wave...

02:36.690 --> 02:39.523
...and aim it not downward...

02:39.593 --> 02:41.686
...but upward against the ceiling!

02:48.769 --> 02:52.671
Ruri, soon we can
see a real flower garden.

02:55.976 --> 03:00.413
The abandoned subway line
leads into darkness.

03:01.048 --> 03:03.983
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

03:04.051 --> 03:07.953
...beneath Tokyo,
this nation's capital...

03:08.021 --> 03:11.889
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

03:12.292 --> 03:15.989
The name of this world
where the sun does not shine is...

03:39.786 --> 03:43.415
The city at night is so cold

03:43.524 --> 03:47.016
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

03:47.094 --> 03:50.552
I wonder if I can keep going

03:50.631 --> 03:53.259
The important thing...

03:53.333 --> 03:55.494
You must tell me

03:55.569 --> 03:57.161
Please

03:57.237 --> 04:02.174
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

04:02.242 --> 04:07.305
Tell me that's not true

04:07.781 --> 04:11.376
I loved you so much that it hurt

04:11.451 --> 04:15.148
Everything was sparkling all around

04:15.222 --> 04:18.555
There was nothing to be afraid of

04:18.625 --> 04:22.391
I believed in that

04:22.462 --> 04:25.898
That moment when
my passions stirred

04:25.966 --> 04:29.561
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

04:29.636 --> 04:32.764
I will never forget that moment

04:32.839 --> 04:36.502
I will never say I want to go back

04:36.577 --> 04:42.345
I just want to see you one more time

04:53.961 --> 04:55.629
The Surface - The Fateful Encounter

04:55.629 --> 04:56.863
The Surface - The Fateful Encounter
You really are funny, Asagi.

04:56.863 --> 04:58.330
You really are funny, Asagi.

04:58.398 --> 05:02.198
It's okay to call me Rumina.

05:02.703 --> 05:07.265
You don't ever get into fights
and you're so kind, Rumina.

05:07.908 --> 05:10.399
I suppose.
I hate getting into fights.

05:11.078 --> 05:13.308
It's so barbaric.

05:13.947 --> 05:14.572
Yeah.

05:14.648 --> 05:17.617
That's right. Only barbaric people fight.

05:18.218 --> 05:20.379
So, please.

05:20.988 --> 05:25.982
I just hope that you can
stay out of fights.

05:27.427 --> 05:27.654
Okay!

05:29.096 --> 05:30.358
Yeah!

05:30.831 --> 05:34.892
Finally, I got a girl to hold my hand!

05:35.702 --> 05:36.259
Huh?

05:36.870 --> 05:39.532
Why is it so cold and hard?

05:40.274 --> 05:42.606
Do girls' hands feel like this?

05:43.043 --> 05:44.738
And it's even ringing?!

05:49.082 --> 05:50.344
It was a dream?!

05:50.417 --> 05:51.315
Damn!

05:53.720 --> 05:54.652
How dare you...

05:54.721 --> 05:58.122
...interrupt my dream of a "rose
- colored academic life"!

06:02.262 --> 06:03.354
What?!

06:44.338 --> 06:46.465
I let my guard down.

06:48.075 --> 06:50.509
All right.
Come at me from anywhere!

06:54.481 --> 06:57.382
Asagi Style Martial Arts Master

06:59.753 --> 07:02.244
Rumina! It's time!

07:04.224 --> 07:06.988
He's sure making
a real fuss today!

07:24.678 --> 07:27.374
That's enough, Gramps!

07:48.635 --> 07:50.535
I wonder if he's asleep.

07:50.771 --> 07:52.033
Hey, Gramps!

07:54.975 --> 07:56.499
Is he gone?

08:02.983 --> 08:04.473
What's this?

08:05.852 --> 08:07.149
"Good morning, Rumina..."

08:07.587 --> 08:10.112
"You finally begin
senior high school today.

08:10.590 --> 08:12.956
I want you to work hard
and do your best.

08:13.026 --> 08:15.153
To celebrate your success...

08:15.228 --> 08:18.629
...I'm going to
the hot springs for a while.

08:19.166 --> 08:22.624
Since I'll be away, I expect you
to take care of the house.

08:22.869 --> 08:24.564
Just because you're alone...

08:24.638 --> 08:28.039
...doesn't mean that you can
slack off on your training!"

08:29.009 --> 08:30.533
Training, huh?

08:31.344 --> 08:33.369
It's more like risking my life
every morning.

08:45.025 --> 08:46.822
Th-This is hot!

08:47.360 --> 08:49.692
What're you doing, Rumina?

08:50.030 --> 08:52.123
You'll be late for school.

08:53.333 --> 08:57.463
"Keep in mind that you must
never let your guard down."

09:01.741 --> 09:02.605
Why, you!

09:02.676 --> 09:05.736
You're just a first year student...

09:05.812 --> 09:08.406
...and you think you can hold
a girl's hand?

09:08.615 --> 09:09.513
Rumina...

09:16.490 --> 09:18.253
Gimme a break.

09:18.458 --> 09:21.621
I just started school and
already I'm faced with this crap!

09:22.262 --> 09:23.923
You all right, boss?

09:23.997 --> 09:25.430
What do you think you're doing?!

09:26.099 --> 09:29.262
Don't you think it looks bad
to make a girl cry...

09:29.336 --> 09:31.566
...when she's just hanging out
with her boyfriend?

09:31.771 --> 09:33.295
Eh?! Seniors?!

09:33.974 --> 09:35.464
You bastard!

09:35.675 --> 09:40.612
I'll make sure you spend the
next three years in a hospital bed!

09:40.814 --> 09:42.782
Prepare yourself, freshman!

09:42.983 --> 09:45.247
It's getting kind of dicey, Rumina.

09:45.318 --> 09:49.687
Ginnosuke, how long
have you been my friend?

09:50.023 --> 09:51.513
Um...

09:52.125 --> 09:54.093
From kindergarten, right?!

09:54.628 --> 09:57.563
Do you think I'll lose to
a bald idiot like that?!

09:59.199 --> 10:01.531
B-Bald idiot?!

10:02.035 --> 10:04.128
It's not about winning or losing.

10:04.571 --> 10:07.972
It's just that you're going to be
a target from now on.

10:08.041 --> 10:11.568
What about the "rose
- colored academic life"...

10:11.645 --> 10:13.078
...you were talking about?

10:14.347 --> 10:16.372
My rose-colored
academic life?

10:16.449 --> 10:18.349
Oh, no!

10:18.752 --> 10:20.185
You forgot, huh?

10:20.554 --> 10:22.021
Your deepest desire?

10:22.622 --> 10:24.351
This isn't good.

10:25.358 --> 10:28.657
I'm going to end up fighting every day!

10:29.095 --> 10:32.792
It's going to be just like junior
high, fighting off those punks.

10:34.034 --> 10:36.161
With my streak of winning fights...

10:36.236 --> 10:39.831
...I just wanted to be known as
the invincible "King of Fighters."

10:41.007 --> 10:43.475
But not in senior high.

10:44.210 --> 10:46.974
I don't want to spend everyday
facing brutal matches.

10:48.682 --> 10:53.142
I mustn't fight with these punks,
even if I feel forced to.

10:56.523 --> 10:57.353
Boss!

10:58.592 --> 11:00.822
Damn, that was a reflex.

11:01.127 --> 11:02.424
W-Why, you!

11:06.399 --> 11:08.128
Now that I'm in it...

11:08.201 --> 11:11.170
...I'm going to have to
deal with all of them!

11:13.239 --> 11:14.035
I give up!

11:15.709 --> 11:17.939
- You're wonderful, Asagi!
- I love strong boys.

11:18.778 --> 11:19.836
That's what you get!

11:21.815 --> 11:22.873
Bring it on!

11:23.249 --> 11:25.615
What're you doing, Rumina?

11:25.919 --> 11:28.444
That's my umbrella!

11:28.688 --> 11:29.848
I've got a new plan!

11:30.156 --> 11:31.123
You bastard!

11:31.591 --> 11:32.785
You're going to get it!

11:34.060 --> 11:35.550
I'll take you all!

11:37.130 --> 11:38.222
Wow...

11:41.868 --> 11:43.335
Stop it.

11:43.503 --> 11:45.266
That's a brand new umbrella.

11:53.113 --> 11:54.671
He's strong...

11:56.416 --> 11:59.852
I'm telling you now to never
lay a hand on me again.

11:59.919 --> 12:01.546
This is terrible.

12:01.888 --> 12:05.051
Now, let me bask in the
hot stares of the girls...

12:05.125 --> 12:06.990
...as they gaze at their new hero.

12:07.060 --> 12:09.028
I don't see it.

12:09.729 --> 12:10.161
Huh?

12:11.031 --> 12:14.592
He wiped out those punks
by himself.

12:15.235 --> 12:18.363
He's only in first year and he's
planning to take over the school?

12:18.605 --> 12:19.867
That's so scary.

12:21.574 --> 12:24.805
I heard he had a pretty bad
reputation back in junior high.

12:25.111 --> 12:26.203
No...

12:26.279 --> 12:30.010
It's safer to stay away
from such a violent boy.

12:33.286 --> 12:34.947
No way...

12:36.823 --> 12:38.313
What about my...

12:38.391 --> 12:41.883
What about my rose-
colored academic life?!

12:46.800 --> 12:47.767
Damn!

12:48.301 --> 12:50.895
All I did was rescue a girl...

12:50.970 --> 12:54.098
...and I'm being ostracized
on my very first day!

12:54.174 --> 12:56.074
That's why I told you to stop.

12:59.679 --> 13:01.306
What was that sound?

13:01.481 --> 13:02.505
Who knows.

13:02.949 --> 13:04.473
Judging from the direction...

13:04.551 --> 13:07.577
...it looks like the main hall
out by your place.

13:34.013 --> 13:35.640
Rumina...

13:36.416 --> 13:39.943
Why do I have to dress like this?

13:40.019 --> 13:42.283
Come on. It really suits you.

13:42.522 --> 13:43.750
You think?

13:44.524 --> 13:48.085
I mean, it could be
a thief or something, right?

13:48.661 --> 13:50.754
Who knows. I wonder.

13:51.831 --> 13:55.733
Don't tell me you just want
to take it out on the thieves!

13:57.871 --> 13:58.394
Huh?

14:07.413 --> 14:09.608
I know you're hiding in there!

14:10.383 --> 14:12.214
Come on you thief!

14:19.125 --> 14:21.719
How dare you call me a thief.

14:23.897 --> 14:25.762
Huh, a blond?!

14:29.636 --> 14:30.568
H-Hey!

14:55.328 --> 14:57.262
What's taking Rumina so long?

14:58.531 --> 15:01.625
Maybe the thieves got him!

15:06.406 --> 15:08.033
Come on! Wake up!

15:08.107 --> 15:08.630
Hey!

15:10.410 --> 15:11.604
Who are you?

15:11.744 --> 15:14.838
More importantly,
what happened to you?

15:17.817 --> 15:19.045
I don't know...

15:20.620 --> 15:23.817
I don't know if I can
explain it so easily.

15:25.425 --> 15:31.125
We just escaped from a place
called the Underground.

15:32.131 --> 15:34.895
I want you to shelter us.

15:36.369 --> 15:37.597
Us?

15:38.271 --> 15:39.602
Underground?

15:40.974 --> 15:42.134
Shelter you?

15:42.909 --> 15:43.739
Wait a minute!

15:43.810 --> 15:46.176
I don't really know
what you're talking about...

15:46.246 --> 15:48.476
...but let's deal with that injury.

15:58.625 --> 16:00.650
What the hell is this?!

16:05.098 --> 16:06.622
The Underground?

16:07.700 --> 16:09.327
An underground world?!

16:09.535 --> 16:10.661
Hey, hey...

16:10.737 --> 16:14.400
Did she seriously come through
this hole from beneath the ground?

16:21.581 --> 16:23.014
It collapsed in on itself.

16:26.286 --> 16:27.275
Ruri!

16:28.588 --> 16:29.350
H-Hey!

16:29.789 --> 16:31.757
Wait a minute!

16:40.300 --> 16:42.768
Hey, Rumina!

16:43.236 --> 16:46.694
I found a thief hiding
in the bushes!

16:46.773 --> 16:48.138
Oh, Chelsea!

16:51.878 --> 16:54.745
Why, you!
How dare you touch Ruri!

16:54.881 --> 16:57.611
Wha...?!
What's the deal with this girl?!

16:57.684 --> 16:59.914
Hang on!
Ginnosuke means no harm!

17:01.020 --> 17:02.851
Don't talk your way out of this!

17:05.425 --> 17:06.392
You blocked me!

17:08.528 --> 17:10.086
Who's this blond girl?

17:10.563 --> 17:13.589
She looks so delicate,
but she's very strong!

17:16.602 --> 17:18.763
No! Wait a minute!

17:18.838 --> 17:22.569
Even with all her weight,
how can she pack such a punch?

17:23.476 --> 17:26.138
No! I can't hold on!

17:31.784 --> 17:35.220
Oh, no! Everything's going blank!

17:35.421 --> 17:37.548
I feel like I'm going to blank out!

17:37.623 --> 17:38.146
No!

17:38.224 --> 17:40.852
I can take an injury like this
for Ruri's sake!

17:45.365 --> 17:46.354
Chelsea!

17:50.536 --> 17:53.369
First there's this
huge hole in the courtyard...

17:53.439 --> 17:56.772
...and just as I'm being attacked,
she suddenly collapses.

17:57.677 --> 17:59.941
And she doesn't want me
to call an ambulance.

18:00.713 --> 18:04.012
And the girl she brought along
is clueless.

18:06.953 --> 18:10.411
Um, can I have another cup?

18:11.591 --> 18:12.285
Sure.

18:12.792 --> 18:14.350
Thank you.

18:15.028 --> 18:19.260
But what if what these two
are saying is true?

18:20.366 --> 18:22.391
Don't get carried away.

18:22.969 --> 18:25.301
If there really is an Underground...

18:25.371 --> 18:26.895
...it's a great discovery!

18:27.340 --> 18:30.400
That's clever thinking.

18:30.777 --> 18:33.803
I can see why you want to
join the science club.

18:35.748 --> 18:37.841
Uh, should I close the window?

18:38.451 --> 18:39.110
No.

18:39.685 --> 18:41.118
Please leave it.

18:41.487 --> 18:43.148
But it's kind of cold.

18:43.623 --> 18:44.555
The wind...

18:45.091 --> 18:47.651
This is the first time in my life...

18:47.727 --> 18:49.319
...that I've felt such a fresh wind.

18:50.730 --> 18:51.560
The wind?

18:52.198 --> 18:55.656
I've only looked at walls
my whole life.

18:56.469 --> 19:01.873
So being able to see the distant
scenery makes me really happy.

19:02.308 --> 19:02.831
Huh?

19:03.476 --> 19:06.274
Did I meet her before?

19:07.313 --> 19:08.280
Rumina?

19:10.149 --> 19:10.808
Um...

19:15.555 --> 19:20.618
We don't know anyone
we can depend on in this world.

19:21.127 --> 19:22.719
Would it be possible if...

19:26.065 --> 19:28.124
I'm begging you.

19:28.734 --> 19:29.393
Please...

19:30.636 --> 19:31.625
So soft...

19:32.605 --> 19:35.506
I'm begging you to help us.

19:36.375 --> 19:37.433
Not like my dream.

19:38.778 --> 19:41.872
It's soft and warm.

19:43.449 --> 19:48.944
This is the first time in my life
that a girl has held my hand.

19:49.021 --> 19:52.752
The hand that hit so many people
over the past 15 years.

19:55.561 --> 19:56.653
W-Why, you!

19:56.729 --> 19:58.424
How dare you touch Ruri!

19:59.365 --> 20:01.663
- Chelsea! Stop it!
- Get away from Ruri!

20:02.301 --> 20:04.269
What the hell is this?!

20:04.470 --> 20:08.804
This first encounter that took
place on April 2nd, 2002...

20:09.642 --> 20:14.011
...was to significantly change
the course of my life.

20:18.417 --> 20:20.851
Stand down, my man.

20:23.156 --> 20:26.125
They think they got
away from me...

20:26.192 --> 20:27.591
...but they're wrong.

20:28.528 --> 20:32.794
The traitor Chelsea Rorec,
and...

20:33.432 --> 20:35.229
...the Maiden of Life!

20:43.743 --> 20:48.544
Again, I walk the streets today

20:48.614 --> 20:54.575
As if I have a purpose

20:54.654 --> 21:07.226
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:07.934 --> 21:18.606
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:18.678 --> 21:30.579
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.057 --> 21:39.988
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.066 --> 21:43.797
I tried to listen

21:43.869 --> 21:52.004
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.078 --> 22:00.747
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.429 --> 22:12.265
Preview

22:12.265 --> 22:17.032
Damn! Now some weird guys
are coming after that blond girl!

22:17.903 --> 22:18.801
Huh? What?!

22:18.871 --> 22:21.032
These guys are blowing
each other away with flames!

22:21.107 --> 22:22.904
Who are these guys anyway?!

22:23.242 --> 22:24.607
Who cares about all that!

22:25.011 --> 22:27.536
I just can't stand to watch
anyone make a girl cry!

22:27.880 --> 22:31.543
The invincible Rumina Asagi
will take care of them!

22:32.752 --> 22:35.448
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:35.521 --> 22:36.255
..."Resurrection - The Maiden of Life."

22:36.255 --> 22:37.723
Resurrection - The Maiden of Life
..."Resurrection - The Maiden of Life."

22:37.723 --> 22:40.191
Resurrection - The Maiden of Life
